Description: experimental read-only Linux resource intelligence
 Xynoos HyperCore observes bounded Linux resource telemetry and produces
 experimental resource plans. It runs on demand without a daemon, kernel
 tuning, privileged optimization, desktop startup or shell changes.
 .
 This developer preview does not establish desktop performance benefits.
